</entry><entry thead="no" align='left'><para>$D_\infty$ continuous facet routing   </para>
</entry><entry thead="no" align='left'><para>Priority flood, receiver graph routing    </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no" align='left'><para><bold>Discharge Scaling</bold>   </para>
</entry><entry thead="no" align='left'><para>Droplet volume &amp; kinetic energy   </para>
