</entry><entry thead="no" align='left'><para>Bilinear capacity drop &amp; talus bank collapse   </para>
</entry><entry thead="no" align='left'><para>Synthetic hole filling &amp; gradient blending   </para>
</entry><entry thead="no" align='left'><para>Equilibrium slope $S_{\text{eq}}(A)$ &amp; lake filling    </para>
</entry></row>
